785 0 obj
<<
/A 2354 0 R
/ADBE_FT 2355 0 R
/C /adbe_style_004000
/ID (AD260921-1009-1222-ADBE-000000010726)
/K 0
/P 42 0 R
/Pg 21 0 R
/S /Figure
/Alt (Building up TCMs with perturbation and observational omics data. \(A.\) Perturb-seq data across perturbation modes quantifies molecular responses to causal gene dosage across biological contexts. This generates hypotheses on the cell types and molecular mechanisms by which causal genes affect traits. \(B.\) Features of observational omics data that inform TCMs. cell RNA-seq and ATAC-seq, work robustly across a range of tissues, and can be matched to the readouts of perturbation experiments, enabling the joint modeling of perturbation effects on gene expression and expression profiles of disease-relevant cell types observed in patients. These data will also provide the substrate to infer quantitative effects of variants on gene expression in disease-relevant cell types and states [101, 131, 158]. At the same time, bespoke assays for any given disease will also be needed to connect molecular changes to functional phenotype. Performing both platform omics and these bespoke assays in the same cohort will enable connecting)
/Contents (Building up TCMs with perturbation and observational omics data. \(A.\) Perturb-seq data across perturbation modes quantifies molecular responses to causal gene dosage across biological contexts. This generates hypotheses on the cell types and molecular mechanisms by which causal genes affect traits. \(B.\) Features of observational omics data that inform TCMs. cell RNA-seq and ATAC-seq, work robustly across a range of tissues, and can be matched to the readouts of perturbation experiments, enabling the joint modeling of perturbation effects on gene expression and expression profiles of disease-relevant cell types observed in patients. These data will also provide the substrate to infer quantitative effects of variants on gene expression in disease-relevant cell types and states [101, 131, 158]. At the same time, bespoke assays for any given disease will also be needed to connect molecular changes to functional phenotype. Performing both platform omics and these bespoke assays in the same cohort will enable connecting)
>>
endobj
